                                "sense_id": "f7598545-d3fe-3f93-8cca-2460944b3dea",
                                "text": "Now to end the past 7 days of hell I have gotten the wrong order at Timmy's!!!!!!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f074b63c-567b-4836-95eb-87ba0c4b6b9b",
                                "sense_id": "f7598545-d3fe-3f93-8cca-2460944b3dea",
                                "text": "\"Where do you want to go?\" \"Just down to Timmy's.\" She felt all Canadian-like, calling the Tim Hortons donut chain by the nickname the locals used."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "705b6111-bbdc-43db-b30d-e2223a9951f3",
                                "sense_id": "f7598545-d3fe-3f93-8cca-2460944b3dea",
                                "text": "Back in the car, I turned on the cruise control at a safe 110 kilometres an hour and, thanks to Timmy's donuts and coffee, I began to wake up."
                            }
                        ]
